Joaquín, With only two primary occasions I would not put much hope on a multi-season design. Dynamic parameters describe biological events that take place in transitions between primary occasions, and with only two primary occasions you're left with only one transition. I would consider first a single season model with a temporal effect on detection. The format looks fine to me, but you need more y columns, right?

